# Phase Q/v6: curated design-reference screenshots -- resized copies already
# live in Supabase Storage (design-reference bucket), which is what the app
# actually reads at generation time; the raw local PNGs (up to 11MB each,
# 666MB total across all 10 trades) are redundant with that and never read
# by any code path, so they don't belong in the repo. notes.md write-ups
# stay tracked -- small, useful, no redundancy.
design-reference/**/*.png
design-reference/**/*.jpg
design-reference/.scratch/
.env.local.bak-*
